WEBVTT

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:36.880 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.870 line:0%
[Episode 5]

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:45.900 line:0%
About today's matter,

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.130 line:0%
thank you very much.

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:49.309 line:0%
I think

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.100 line:0%
you should be thanking someone else.

00:01:57.279 --> 00:01:59.430 line:0%
Indeed, this handwriting is very similar to mine,

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.090 line:0%
but you still managed to tell.

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:04.440 line:0%
It's not just me, you know.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.800 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager?

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.000 line:0%
It's very firm and upright in the statement,

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.490 line:0%
but between the lines,

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:18.120 line:0%
it occasionally reveals a feminine touch.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:18.879 line:0%
Yan Xing

00:02:18.879 --> 00:02:21.560 line:0%
was strongly recommended by Prime Minister Zhang back then,

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:23.890 line:0%
but she's now intentionally helping you.

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.120 line:0%
In my opinion,

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.860 line:0%
this matter is quite intriguing.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.400 line:0%
So why did the Grand Empress Dowager...

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.730 line:0%
You've married a wise wife.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:49.160 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:50.240 line:0%
must have taken that nursery rhyme

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:51.200 line:0%
to heart.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:53.600 line:0%
The task she assigned you to do

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:55.000 line:0%
is a tough job.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:57.490 line:0%
Be sure to be careful and cautious.

00:02:57.920 --> 00:02:58.720 line:0%
Certainly.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:17.280 line:0%
[Chengtian Gate]

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:26.379 line:0%
[Chengtian Gate]

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:29.740 line:0%
It seems I've misjudged Madam.

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:30.879 line:0%
Based on her reaction after that incident happened,

00:03:30.879 --> 00:03:32.680 line:0%
she proved to be loyal after all.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.370 line:0%
Even if she didn't write it,

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.210 line:0%
wouldn't I have said it myself?

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.780 line:0%
Her attempt to save me was just a ruse.

00:03:44.879 --> 00:03:46.250 line:0%
Her real purpose was

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:47.680 line:0%
to use this opportunity to overturn the case of

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.480 line:0%
Chen Baiyi's self-immolation.

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:52.180 line:0%
She actually dared to use you, Grand Commander?

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.600 line:0%
And she actually dared to use me.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:55.620 line:0%
How despicable.

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:57.850 line:0%
Let it go.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:58.600 line:0%
She just wanted

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.330 line:0%
to seek justice for Chen Baiyi.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:03.600 line:0%
How did she get

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:04.600 line:0%
my handwriting?

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:07.800 line:0%
She...

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.010 line:0%
She entered your study, Grand Commander.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.660 line:0%
No wonder she imitated my handwriting so well.

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:16.840 line:0%
I didn't expect her

00:04:17.069 --> 00:04:19.530 line:0%
to have a talent for imitating handwriting.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:21.800 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.160 line:0%
She tampered with your memorial.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.820 line:0%
After we return, should we...

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:28.970 line:0%
Keep her around.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:32.540 line:0%
Let's see what other tricks she can pull.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:35.890 line:0%
However, there's one thing

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:38.410 line:0%
that needs to be taken care of immediately.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.540 line:0%
[Prince Xian's Mansion]

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:47.240 line:0%
Your Highness! Your Highness!

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:48.120 line:0%
Something terrible has happened!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.680 line:0%
Outside... Outside...

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:55.240 line:0%
Prince Xian, Xiao Zhong, please receive the imperial edict.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.080 line:0%
I, Xiao Zhong, receive the imperial edict.

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:02.310 line:0%
[Gentle Breeze, Pleasant Weather]

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.400 line:0%
In accordance with Heaven's will and the times,

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.720 line:0%
we hereby issue this clear command.

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.400 line:0%
Prince Xian, Xiao Zhong, is ordered

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:10.960 line:0%
to go to Fengxiang Prefecture for an inspection tour.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:12.120 line:0%
Prince Xian, Xiao Zhong,

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.520 line:0%
possessing both literary and martial talents,

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:15.600 line:0%
endowed with skills in governance and economy,

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:17.720 line:0%
embodying benevolence and virtue in his conduct,

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:19.880 line:0%
accomplishing tasks with righteousness and courage,

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.080 line:0%
is both virtuous and talented,

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.520 line:0%
bringing blessings to the region.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:25.280 line:0%
Now, Fengxiang Prefecture faces hardships due to drought,

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:27.240 line:0%
requiring planning and direction.

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:28.960 line:0%
The regency requires absolute authority,

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:31.160 line:0%
thus we specially command Prince Xian to conduct an inspection,

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.400 line:0%
entrusting him with supervisory duties,

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:33.720 line:0%
to uphold our nation's prestige

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.120 line:0%
and comfort the hearts of the people.

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:36.700 line:0%
The competent department, please execute this order.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:37.880 line:0%
I, Xiao Zhong,

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:41.540 line:0%
receive the edict and express my gratitude for this grace.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.660 line:0%
When shall I depart?

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:53.280 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:54.880 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has given her order.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:55.680 line:0%
Since this matter is of great importance,

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:56.880 line:0%
we shall not delay for even a moment.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:58.040 line:0%
For Your Highness's journey,

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.440 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau will be fully responsible for your escort.

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:00.720 line:0%
The Grand Commander has made all the arrangements.

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:03.320 line:0%
Please be at ease as you depart, Your Highness.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:07.600 line:0%
Alright.

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:10.960 line:0%
During my absence,

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:11.600 line:0%
make sure you

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.400 line:0%
take good care of these flowers.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.240 line:0%
The temperature difference between morning and evening is significant now.

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:17.200 line:0%
The best time to water is between 9 and 11 in the morning.

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:18.360 line:0%
Especially my

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:19.690 line:0%
Imperial Yellow Peony.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:21.050 line:0%
Yes, Your Highness.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:22.560 line:0%
Let's depart.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:23.840 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:24.520 line:0%
please.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.600 line:0%
I wonder if the memorial worked.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.610 line:0%
Madam! Madam!

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:42.440 line:0%
Madam.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.280 line:0%
News from the palace says

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:47.540 line:0%
the Grand Commander has left the palace.

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:49.000 line:0%
You can rest assured now.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.890 line:0%
Please retire early.

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:52.080 line:0%
Okay.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:53.320 line:0%
I'll wait a bit longer then.

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:54.120 line:0%
Okay.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.240 line:0%
Madam.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.320 line:0%
Here's the osmanthus and lotus seed soup.

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:04.450 line:0%
Please drink it while it's still warm.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.720 line:0%
This maid looks unfamiliar.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:27.360 line:0%
[East of the bamboo forest at the back door]

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.680 line:0%
I pay my respects to you, Prime Minister.

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.040 line:0%
Sixth Lady of the Yan family,

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:48.209 line:0%
you are indeed exceptionally clever.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.300 line:0%
Shen Du was taken to the palace earlier

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.850 line:0%
and hasn't returned to the mansion yet.

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:53.920 line:0%
If you want to inquire about the progress of the case, Prime Minister,

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:55.520 line:0%
I'm afraid you'll have to leave empty-handed.

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.600 line:0%
I know Shen Du's whereabouts.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:58.959 line:0%
Today, I came to see you

00:07:58.959 --> 00:08:01.720 line:0%
just to clarify the Yan family's position.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:08.480 line:0%
I don't quite understand.

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:09.560 line:0%
Please elaborate, Prime Minister.

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:10.880 line:0%
Upon hearing the street nursery rhymes,

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.880 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager was furious.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:14.040 line:0%
She immediately issued an edict,

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:15.400 line:0%
ordering Prince Xian

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:17.660 line:0%
to oversee disaster relief in Fengxiang Prefecture.

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:18.600 line:0%
When he left,

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.520 line:0%
he wasn't even allowed to bring attendants.

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.440 line:0%
Moreover,

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:24.170 line:0%
the route of his inspection tour was concealed.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:26.170 line:0%
Do you think, Prime Minister,

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:27.440 line:0%
that the Grand Empress Dowager suspects

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.640 line:0%
Prince Xian is behind the nursery rhyme incident,

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:31.640 line:0%
and thus intends to take action against him?

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:32.400 line:0%
But...

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:35.160 line:0%
Even a vicious tiger won't eat its own cubs.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.200 line:0%
It's such a long journey.

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.859 line:0%
If something really happens,

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.440 line:0%
it will be too late.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.320 line:0%
Let me ask you.

00:08:41.589 --> 00:08:43.400 line:0%
Since the Grand Empress Dowager took charge of the court,

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:45.100 line:0%
she's been ignoring the legitimate rule of the Cang State.

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:46.480 line:0%
Does your Yan family

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:47.600 line:0%
still remember

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.180 line:0%
what the surname of the late emperor was?

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:52.040 line:0%
I'm solely focused on investigating cases and seeking justice.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:53.000 line:0%
As for court affairs,

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.480 line:0%
as a woman, I truly don't understand them

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:56.580 line:0%
and am even less capable of shouldering such great responsibilities.

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:57.600 line:0%
Naive.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.600 line:0%
You want to enter the court,

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.280 line:0%
involve yourself in cases,

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.060 line:0%
and yet remain uninvolved?

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:05.120 line:0%
Not just you, Yan Xing,

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:06.620 line:0%
but your entire Yan family

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:08.710 line:0%
will find it hard to escape involvement.

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:11.040 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager prioritizes the welfare of the state.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:12.640 line:0%
Perhaps you're overthinking it, Prime Minister.

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:13.640 line:0%
Could a serial case

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:14.700 line:0%
and a nursery rhyme

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:15.480 line:0%
really be able to

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:17.080 line:0%
stir up such an uproar?

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.320 line:0%
"Buddha swallows sins."

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:21.490 line:0%
This nursery rhyme is indeed vicious,

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.080 line:0%
directly pointing out that the Grand Empress Dowager's position is illegitimate.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.240 line:0%
If it spreads,

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:27.960 line:0%
it won't just affect Prince Xian alone.

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:30.560 line:0%
What exactly do you want me to do, Prime Minister?

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:32.210 line:0%
I've sent people to investigate and found out that

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.890 line:0%
the Shen family uses carrier pigeons

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:36.010 line:0%
to issue orders and relay messages.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.360 line:0%
For Prince Xian's tour this time,

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.120 line:0%
they will certainly

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.870 line:0%
use carrier pigeons to send messages, too.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.280 line:0%
You must hurry up

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:43.020 line:0%
and find Prince Xian's route.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:44.720 line:0%
When the time comes,

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:46.320 line:0%
regardless of whether Shen Du

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:47.640 line:0%
intends to assassinate Prince Xian

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:49.440 line:0%
or genuinely wants to protect him,

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:51.240 line:0%
we'll be prepared in advance.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:53.010 line:0%
Carrier pigeons...

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:09.290 line:0%
Honey, this is your own residence.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.160 line:0%
Why are you sneaking around

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:13.440 line:0%
as if you're a thief?

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:17.730 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.210 line:0%
I've been eagerly waiting

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:20.440 line:0%
for your return all this time.

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:21.880 line:0%
When did you come home?

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:24.000 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager didn't give you a hard time, did she?

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.960 line:0%
You had me worried all night for nothing.

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:27.060 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.000 line:0%
Why put on this act?

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:31.960 line:0%
Do you think this

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.280 line:0%
will win my favor?

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.480 line:0%
If you don't buy it,

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:38.000 line:0%
then forget it.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.080 line:0%
Satisfied now?

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:43.520 line:0%
As a scribe of the Ministry of Justice,

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:44.950 line:0%
you should know that forging a memorial

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.150 line:0%
is a serious crime.

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:48.320 line:0%
Moreover, your few words

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:50.640 line:0%
have stirred up so much trouble in the court.

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:51.800 line:0%
At that time,

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:54.490 line:0%
I was desperate to save you.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.720 line:0%
Besides, I'd never written a memorial before that.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:58.680 line:0%
How could I have known what to write

00:10:58.680 --> 00:10:59.880 line:0%
and what not to write?

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:01.560 line:0%
Save me?

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:08.290 line:0%
It's more like you were just using me as a tool.

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:12.480 line:0%
It's already late night.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.120 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:14.720 line:0%
Let's hurry inside and rest.

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:31.760 line:0%
Chen Baiyi, a talented scholar from a humble background,

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:33.280 line:0%
immolated himself at the Ming Hall of the Cang State.

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:35.040 line:0%
His writings, crafted with years of painstaking effort,

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.080 line:0%
were all stolen.

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:38.360 line:0%
The Cang State is in dire need of justice.

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:40.840 line:0%
How much longer will this corruption inspection take?

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:41.640 line:0%
Everyone!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.480 line:0%
Why should we study so hard

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:44.190 line:0%
only to become

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:45.920 line:0%
study companions for the noble families' children

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:47.560 line:0%
and be their shadows?

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:48.400 line:0%
We quit!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:50.040 line:0%
-We quit!
-We quit!

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:52.060 line:0%
Look at you bunch of poor wretches.

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.490 line:0%
Without the noble families,

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:54.970 line:0%
you wouldn't even be qualified to enter the Hongwen Academy,

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:55.770 line:0%
let alone

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:57.590 line:0%
make a name for yourselves.

00:11:57.800 --> 00:11:58.840 line:0%
Let me tell you.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:00.720 line:0%
You were born inferior.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:01.810 line:0%
What did you say?

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:04.580 line:0%
You're nothing but a plagiarizing fraud!

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:10.530 line:0%
Stop fighting!

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:11.950 line:0%
Stop fighting!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:13.120 line:0%
Stop fighting!

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:14.080 line:0%
Stop fighting!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:17.120 line:0%
This is outrageous!

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:19.090 line:0%
What a disgrace!

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:26.920 line:0%
All the same.

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:28.800 line:0%
Saying nothing of substance!

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:30.220 line:0%
Regarding the self-immolation case at the Ming Hall,

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.280 line:0%
Imperial Security Bureau,

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.360 line:0%
what's the result of your investigation?

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.600 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:35.240 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.240 line:0%
has further verified and confirmed

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:38.920 line:0%
that it's indeed as previously stated

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:39.960 line:0%
that scholar Chen Baiyi

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.960 line:0%
had his essay stolen by the eldest son of the Jin family.

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:43.960 line:0%
When he went to reason with them, he was driven out by the Jin family,

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.680 line:0%
and he got publicly humiliated and beaten.

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:46.720 line:0%
Filled with resentment,

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:47.800 line:0%
he had no way to report to the authorities.

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:50.460 line:0%
In the end, he self-immolated to make his point.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.960 line:0%
The disturbance caused by the students of Hongwen Academy

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.280 line:0%
has not yet subsided,

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:58.200 line:0%
and now there's another report from Jiangnan!

00:12:58.200 --> 00:12:59.040 line:0%
Look.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:12:59.920 line:0%
Just look!

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:01.400 line:0%
"Those who review the examination papers

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:03.200 line:0%
do not follow the great path of humanity,

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:04.160 line:0%
and those who pass the examination

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:06.490 line:0%
hardly help seek fairness in this world."

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:08.840 line:0%
Is this how the scholars of the world

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:09.640 line:0%
view

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:12.220 line:0%
our Cang State's recruitment of talents?

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:14.460 line:0%
Please calm your anger, Your Majesty.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:17.960 line:0%
Mother.

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:21.560 line:0%
Selecting talented individuals is a matter of great importance for our state.

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:23.640 line:0%
The noble families should never have

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:25.200 line:0%
used this to maintain their status,

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.680 line:0%
causing such a dispute.

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:28.040 line:0%
I believe

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.480 line:0%
whether from humble origins

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:30.560 line:0%
or noble families,

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:32.210 line:0%
everyone should compete on the same stage.

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:33.510 line:0%
Gathering talents from all walks of life,

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:36.370 line:0%
that is how we should select the worthy and capable.

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:40.250 line:0%
I don't think this is advisable.

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:43.070 line:0%
The system of hereditary appointments is an ancestral institution.

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:45.350 line:0%
How can we change it so abruptly?

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:49.570 line:0%
I'm afraid Your Highness has been spending too much time

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.500 line:0%
with those scholars from humble backgrounds,

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:53.040 line:0%
composing poetry and couplets,

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:55.800 line:0%
and has become momentarily blinded by chaff.

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.240 line:0%
Those from humble backgrounds

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:02.160 line:0%
are also citizens of our Cang State.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.920 line:0%
I'm merely speaking a few words on their behalf.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.360 line:0%
Why are you reacting so strongly, Prime Minister Zhang?

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.240 line:0%
Could it be that

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.760 line:0%
the matter of that young man of the Jin family stealing the essay

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:11.560 line:0%
as well as his deceitful actions

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:14.480 line:0%
have long been known by you, Prime Minister Zhang?

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:16.320 line:0%
Your Majesty, please be clear.

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.160 line:0%
All I'm thinking about

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.600 line:0%
is the well-being of the Cang State and its people.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:21.600 line:0%
We can't select people based solely on their essays.

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:25.040 line:0%
Family background is also an important factor.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:27.280 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang, I'm afraid you're mistaken.

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:29.160 line:0%
Stubbornly clinging to the privileges of the noble families

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:30.160 line:0%
has already led to

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.820 line:0%
so much fraud and corruption.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:35.680 line:0%
We should choose capable and virtuous people to hold appropriate positions.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:36.810 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.920 line:0%
But all the victims in the Ximing Temple serial case

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.960 line:0%
were from noble families.

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:42.260 line:0%
It's possible that

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:45.290 line:0%
some commoner was bewitched

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:47.080 line:0%
and committed the crime.

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:50.700 line:0%
Bewitched?

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:52.760 line:0%
It's better to ease a problem rather than block it.

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:53.760 line:0%
Suppression ultimately

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:55.340 line:0%
cannot solve the problem.

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:56.920 line:0%
How could you not know

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:59.320 line:0%
such a simple truth, Prime Minister Zhang?

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:00.560 line:0%
Could it be that

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:02.680 line:0%
you want Her Majesty to bear

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:03.880 line:0%
the blame for this injustice

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.880 line:0%
against all commoners in the world?

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:09.020 line:0%
This humble servant's loyalty to Her Majesty

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:10.680 line:0%
is as clear as the sun and moon.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.440 line:0%
If we open up the commoners' path to officialdom,

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:13.640 line:0%
it's absolutely unacceptable,

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.880 line:0%
Your Majesty!

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:17.250 line:0%
Alright, alright, Prime Minister Zhang.

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:18.360 line:0%
Please rise.

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.580 line:0%
The two of you are only arguing

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:23.920 line:0%
for the sake of our Cang State.

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:25.560 line:0%
Mr. Shen.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.360 line:0%
You've investigated the case of

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.200 line:0%
self-immolation at the Ming Hall thoroughly, right?

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:31.160 line:0%
So what's your opinion?

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:35.000 line:0%
Among those from humble backgrounds,

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:36.360 line:0%
there are indeed some people with true talent and learning,

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:38.120 line:0%
and they do need an opportunity.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:38.920 line:0%
I think

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:40.300 line:0%
we could choose a

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.960 line:0%
fair assessment method to seek out the talented

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.920 line:0%
for Your Majesty's consideration.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.230 line:0%
Alright then. Let's start with

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:49.640 line:0%
a pilot program at the Hongwen Academy.

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:53.420 line:0%
Select worthy commoners to study at the academy.

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:56.290 line:0%
You're wise, Your Majesty.

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:06.600 line:0%
Oh, it's you.

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.040 line:0%
Come, young lady. Sit here.

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:17.000 line:0%
Come. Sit down.

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:21.740 line:0%
Thanks to you,

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.760 line:0%
my unfilial grandson

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:26.440 line:0%
could finally rest in peace.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:27.960 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.240 line:0%
Regarding these remains, should we...

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:31.680 line:0%
The articles written by Scholar Chen

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.680 line:0%
are highly praised by the students.

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:35.500 line:0%
I've brought a copy for you.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.110 line:0%
It's a pity that

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:41.940 line:0%
I can't read.

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:44.600 line:0%
I'll read it to you.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:50.180 line:0%
The Song of West Island.

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:53.600 line:0%
Remembering plum blossoms on West Island.

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:56.360 line:0%
Picking plum blossoms to send north of the river.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.490 line:0%
Wearing a thin shirt, red as apricots.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:17.600 line:0%
Madam

00:17:17.619 --> 00:17:19.820 line:0%
is really willing to take on extra work.

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:24.369 line:0%
But the fairness and justice she wants

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:27.500 line:0%
is not so easy to achieve.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:52.330 line:0%
I didn't know

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:54.320 line:0%
you had such a plan.

00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:57.820 line:0%
What happened?

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:06.280 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has issued an edict

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:08.320 line:0%
on starting a pilot program at the Hongwen Academy

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:10.770 line:0%
for worthy scholars from humble backgrounds to study there.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:11.840 line:0%
Really?

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:22.880 line:0%
I mean,

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.700 line:0%
I wouldn't dare take credit for this.

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:29.300 line:0%
It's all thanks to your mediation, Grand Commander.

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.120 line:0%
This time,

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:32.120 line:0%
you'll surely gain a reputation

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:33.200 line:0%
among the scholars from humble backgrounds

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:35.160 line:0%
for being discerning and perceptive.

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:35.920 line:0%
How nice.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.760 line:0%
I'm happy for you.

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:39.820 line:0%
Do you think that's what I care about?

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:45.090 line:0%
In the future, if you want to take any action,

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:46.520 line:0%
inform me in advance.

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:48.720 line:0%
Otherwise, I won't let you off easily.

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:49.800 line:0%
Right.

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:51.680 line:0%
You're already known as the White Ghost.

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:54.210 line:0%
Surely you don't care about your reputation.

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.090 line:0%
What trouble are you going out to cause

00:19:04.090 --> 00:19:05.660 line:0%
so late at night?

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:11.100 line:0%
I'm going out for some exercise.

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:11.960 line:0%
A little jog.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:12.760 line:0%
If I don't tire myself out,

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:14.080 line:0%
how can I possibly fall asleep next to you,

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.040 line:0%
White Ghost?

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:21.500 line:0%
Madam.

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:33.120 line:0%
Does she go jogging every night?

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.390 line:0%
Madam says it helps with sleep.

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:50.040 line:0%
It's indeed too bright.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.220 line:0%
The lights haven't been changed.

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:54.080 line:0%
They're still the same as before.

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:56.200 line:0%
Do you all find it bright too?

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:58.730 line:0%
Everyone in the mansion has gotten used to it.

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:06.360 line:0%
I remember

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:07.600 line:0%
there's a type of fabric from Xichen

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.000 line:0%
that can block out light.

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:10.850 line:0%
Have a curtain made from it.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:11.800 line:0%
Yes.

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:12.720 line:0%
Also,

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:15.440 line:0%
from now on, those lights over there,

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.440 line:0%
don't light them.

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:23.640 line:0%
Save where we can.

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:25.680 line:0%
Yes.

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:55.880 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:05.760 line:0%
Since you've already barged in,

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:07.120 line:0%
come on in.

00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:12.800 line:0%
[Clear Punishment and Strict Law]

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:17.560 line:0%
Get down here.

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:21.130 line:0%
[Clear Punishment and Strict Law]

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:30.320 line:0%
The identities of the 12 victims at Ximing Temple

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:31.680 line:0%
have all been verified.

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:32.960 line:0%
These paired corpses

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:34.400 line:0%
were mostly acquainted in life,

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:35.600 line:0%
often seen together.

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:37.530 line:0%
[Clear Punishment and Strict Law]

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:37.040 line:0%
However, there are still two pairs

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:37.840 line:0%
for which we haven't found

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:38.760 line:0%
any prior connection.

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:39.240 line:0%
Wasn't it said that

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:41.240 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau is highly efficient?

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:42.000 line:0%
How come after so long,

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.000 line:0%
you still haven't figured this out?

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:48.240 line:0%
The male corpses were all from noble families.

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.120 line:0%
Based on their appearance and their clothing

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:49.920 line:0%
while they were alive,

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:51.480 line:0%
they could be quickly identified.

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:52.480 line:0%
However, those female corpses

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:53.720 line:0%
all had their faces disfigured,

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:54.560 line:0%
and they had no household registration.

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:56.040 line:0%
So it indeed took us some time.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:56.840 line:0%
Moreover,

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.120 line:0%
the time of their disappearance

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.520 line:0%
and the time of death of the bodies

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:00.400 line:0%
don't match.

00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:01.560 line:0%
Don't match?

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:05.640 line:0%
Is it also true for the male victims?

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:06.400 line:0%
Yes, it is.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:08.600 line:0%
The time difference is as short as two or three months,

00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:10.260 line:0%
and as long as one or two years.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:11.920 line:0%
So after the murderer abducted them,

00:22:11.920 --> 00:22:13.720 line:0%
they were held captive for such a long time?

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:15.360 line:0%
That was indeed more risky.

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:16.760 line:0%
As for the female victims,

00:22:16.760 --> 00:22:18.000 line:0%
do they match the list of missing courtesans

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:19.360 line:0%
that the constables previously found?

00:22:19.360 --> 00:22:20.080 line:0%
Yes.

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:20.920 line:0%
They were the courtesans

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:22.840 line:0%
who went missing from various pleasure houses.

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:24.910 line:0%
Are you saying they were all courtesans?

00:22:24.910 --> 00:22:25.710 line:0%
Yes.

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:26.840 line:0%
Something's off here.

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:27.770 line:0%
What's off?

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:28.640 line:0%
The gold ornaments

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:30.320 line:0%
those female corpses were wearing.

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:31.650 line:0%
Something's not right.

00:22:41.920 --> 00:22:43.450 line:0%
Come on, take a look at this.

00:22:44.960 --> 00:22:46.220 line:0%
It's truly exquisite.

00:22:51.180 --> 00:22:52.960 line:0%
The quality is clearly excellent.

00:22:52.960 --> 00:22:54.560 line:0%
It's indeed very beautiful.

00:22:58.790 --> 00:23:00.760 line:0%
I felt something was off that day.

00:23:01.120 --> 00:23:02.380 line:0%
These gold ornaments,

00:23:02.400 --> 00:23:03.600 line:0%
compared to other accessories,

00:23:03.600 --> 00:23:05.040 line:0%
all seem too refined.

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:07.560 line:0%
They don't look like they're from ordinary gold shops.

00:23:07.560 --> 00:23:08.540 line:0%
These items

00:23:08.640 --> 00:23:10.240 line:0%
probably aren't something ordinary courtesans

00:23:10.240 --> 00:23:11.680 line:0%
could easily obtain.

00:23:13.520 --> 00:23:15.280 line:0%
I'm not very familiar with these things,

00:23:15.280 --> 00:23:16.480 line:0%
but Chuichui once said

00:23:16.480 --> 00:23:18.040 line:0%
that all renowned craftsmen

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.600 line:0%
have a habit of leaving their own marks

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:20.600 line:0%
on their works.

00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:25.960 line:0%
The goldsmiths of Bijiang Gold Shop

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:28.120 line:0%
all used to work in the imperial treasury,

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:29.990 line:0%
crafting jewelry for nobles.

00:23:30.120 --> 00:23:31.240 line:0%
Although it's only been open for ten years,

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:33.500 line:0%
it has surpassed many century-old shops

00:23:34.200 --> 00:23:35.280 line:0%
and become the city's leading establishment.

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:36.230 line:0%
Take care.

00:23:38.960 --> 00:23:39.880 line:0%
Welcome, esteemed guests.

00:23:39.880 --> 00:23:41.480 line:0%
What would you like to buy?

00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:43.400 line:0%
Hairpins.

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:45.520 line:0%
Bring out your finest ones.

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:46.320 line:0%
All of them.

00:23:46.320 --> 00:23:47.120 line:0%
Yes.

00:24:06.360 --> 00:24:08.890 line:0%
Do you find any of these satisfactory, Madam?

00:24:11.080 --> 00:24:12.250 line:0%
This one...

00:24:13.200 --> 00:24:14.440 line:0%
Madam, you have great taste.

00:24:14.440 --> 00:24:15.560 line:0%
-This one is...
-How much is it?

00:24:15.560 --> 00:24:16.360 line:0%
Fifty taels.

00:24:23.640 --> 00:24:24.360 line:0%
I told you,

00:24:24.360 --> 00:24:27.360 line:0%
ordinary courtesans wouldn't be able to afford this.

00:24:39.090 --> 00:24:40.380 line:0%
Honey,

00:24:41.780 --> 00:24:43.930 line:0%
I want to buy something pretty.

00:24:44.120 --> 00:24:45.320 line:0%
When the boss comes,

00:24:45.320 --> 00:24:47.980 line:0%
could you ask him to bring out the best they have?

00:24:53.450 --> 00:24:56.510 line:0%
Purple Shoot tea is currently a tribute to the emperor.

00:24:57.040 --> 00:24:58.200 line:0%
Moreover, Yangxian Purple Shoot tea

00:24:58.200 --> 00:25:00.060 line:0%
is considered the most precious.

00:25:00.440 --> 00:25:01.560 line:0%
Previously, I was granted the emperor's favor

00:25:01.560 --> 00:25:02.740 line:0%
and was rewarded with a few taels of this tea.

00:25:02.740 --> 00:25:05.120 line:0%
I've kept it at home and couldn't bring myself to drink it.

00:25:05.120 --> 00:25:06.440 line:0%
Your shop is really generous.

00:25:06.440 --> 00:25:08.360 line:0%
This is my boss's prized collection.

00:25:08.360 --> 00:25:09.240 line:0%
Only when we receive distinguished guests

00:25:09.240 --> 00:25:10.590 line:0%
do we dare to serve it.

00:25:11.520 --> 00:25:13.320 line:0%
Your boss still hasn't arrived?

00:25:16.520 --> 00:25:17.680 line:0%
It's you, Grand Commander,

00:25:17.680 --> 00:25:19.080 line:0%
and your beloved wife.

00:25:19.200 --> 00:25:21.200 line:0%
May I ask what brings you both

00:25:21.240 --> 00:25:22.720 line:0%
to my humble establishment today?

00:25:22.720 --> 00:25:24.240 line:0%
If I'm not mistaken,

00:25:25.320 --> 00:25:26.340 line:0%
you are Administer Yang,

00:25:26.340 --> 00:25:28.670 line:0%
who's been serving Princess Ying, right?

00:25:29.610 --> 00:25:30.880 line:0%
[Administer Yang]

00:25:31.190 --> 00:25:33.080 line:0%
You have a keen eye, Grand Commander.

00:25:33.080 --> 00:25:35.240 line:0%
You actually remember a lowly servant like me.

00:25:35.240 --> 00:25:36.920 line:0%
I'm truly honored.

00:25:39.920 --> 00:25:41.320 line:0%
These gold ornaments...

00:25:42.040 --> 00:25:43.300 line:0%
Do you recognize them?

00:25:55.960 --> 00:25:56.850 line:0%
This...

00:25:56.880 --> 00:25:59.680 line:0%
Indeed, some of them are from my Bijiang Gold Shop.

00:25:59.680 --> 00:26:00.480 line:0%
Good.

00:26:01.200 --> 00:26:02.640 line:0%
I want the list of the buyers

00:26:02.640 --> 00:26:04.040 line:0%
of these gold ornaments.

00:26:08.600 --> 00:26:09.600 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:26:09.600 --> 00:26:12.000 line:0%
You're putting me in a difficult position.

00:26:13.840 --> 00:26:15.440 line:0%
My gold shop has been open for years,

00:26:15.440 --> 00:26:17.360 line:0%
with so many customers coming and going.

00:26:17.360 --> 00:26:18.680 line:0%
The jewelry we've sold over the years

00:26:18.680 --> 00:26:20.200 line:0%
is countless.

00:26:20.320 --> 00:26:22.440 line:0%
How could I possibly remember them all?

00:26:22.440 --> 00:26:24.840 line:0%
As for hairpins that cost fifty taels each,

00:26:25.040 --> 00:26:25.840 line:0%
for ordinary people,

00:26:25.840 --> 00:26:27.680 line:0%
even if they spent everything they had,

00:26:27.680 --> 00:26:30.210 line:0%
they couldn't afford to buy many, could they?

00:26:31.520 --> 00:26:33.250 line:0%
If you can't show me the ledger,

00:26:33.360 --> 00:26:34.640 line:0%
why don't you tell me

00:26:35.960 --> 00:26:37.400 line:0%
who can?

00:26:40.480 --> 00:26:41.280 line:0%
Well...

00:26:46.080 --> 00:26:47.880 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau is investigating cases here.

00:26:47.880 --> 00:26:49.480 line:0%
If there's any concealment,

00:26:49.840 --> 00:26:51.100 line:0%
it'll be very serious.

00:26:51.520 --> 00:26:53.250 line:0%
Can you bear the consequences?

00:26:54.160 --> 00:26:56.360 line:0%
Please wait a moment, Grand Commander.

00:26:57.800 --> 00:26:59.360 line:0%
I'll go fetch it right away.

00:27:24.720 --> 00:27:25.650 line:0%
This one is nice.

00:27:29.560 --> 00:27:30.400 line:0%
This one it is.

00:27:30.920 --> 00:27:32.120 line:0%
The design is simple.

00:27:32.420 --> 00:27:33.420 line:0%
It suits you well.

00:27:44.640 --> 00:27:46.500 line:0%
Are you giving this to me as a gift?

00:27:51.560 --> 00:27:52.560 line:0%
You're not expecting me to

00:27:52.560 --> 00:27:53.820 line:0%
buy it myself, are you?

00:28:17.000 --> 00:28:19.440 line:0%
These gold ornaments worn by the female victims

00:28:19.440 --> 00:28:21.320 line:0%
are indeed quite expensive.

00:28:21.640 --> 00:28:23.040 line:0%
The list of those who bought these ornaments

00:28:23.040 --> 00:28:24.760 line:0%
doesn't include those courtesans.

00:28:24.760 --> 00:28:27.820 line:0%
However, there are a few names I'm quite familiar with.

00:28:36.480 --> 00:28:37.940 line:0%
Are they the male victims?

00:28:38.630 --> 00:28:39.560 line:0%
That's correct.

00:28:40.360 --> 00:28:42.240 line:0%
They did spend lavishly

00:28:42.320 --> 00:28:44.320 line:0%
just to make beautiful women happy.

00:28:52.570 --> 00:28:54.720 line:0%
Their accounts are a mess.

00:28:54.720 --> 00:28:57.580 line:0%
Many shipments are only marked as "banquet gifts,"

00:28:57.630 --> 00:28:58.760 line:0%
without quantities

00:28:58.760 --> 00:29:00.290 line:0%
or specific destinations.

00:29:00.920 --> 00:29:02.980 line:0%
Gold shops host banquets quite often

00:29:03.280 --> 00:29:05.240 line:0%
for the wives of the powerful.

00:29:05.560 --> 00:29:07.240 line:0%
I suppose those were given away as gifts.

00:29:07.240 --> 00:29:08.480 line:0%
So generous?

00:29:10.080 --> 00:29:11.480 line:0%
That Administer Yang

00:29:11.480 --> 00:29:12.680 line:0%
is quite impressive.

00:29:13.460 --> 00:29:14.520 line:0%
The impressive one

00:29:15.400 --> 00:29:16.520 line:0%
is someone else.

00:29:18.320 --> 00:29:19.830 line:0%
Administer Yang

00:29:20.120 --> 00:29:22.000 line:0%
is a confidant of Princess Ying.

00:29:22.120 --> 00:29:23.080 line:0%
Her rank and status

00:29:23.080 --> 00:29:24.920 line:0%
are far above ordinary palace servants.

00:29:24.920 --> 00:29:26.580 line:0%
Yet, just now, in front of you,

00:29:26.840 --> 00:29:28.480 line:0%
she kept referring to herself as a mere servant,

00:29:28.480 --> 00:29:29.640 line:0%
and she obediently handed over

00:29:29.640 --> 00:29:30.600 line:0%
this register.

00:29:30.920 --> 00:29:31.800 line:0%
It feels like

00:29:31.800 --> 00:29:32.800 line:0%
she was afraid of offending

00:29:32.800 --> 00:29:34.270 line:0%
a big shot like you.

00:29:34.320 --> 00:29:36.380 line:0%
Playing dumb to take advantage of me.

00:29:37.800 --> 00:29:38.920 line:0%
It was just because she didn't want you

00:29:38.920 --> 00:29:41.250 line:0%
to continue investigating the gold shop.

00:29:42.200 --> 00:29:43.480 line:0%
Behind her

00:29:43.600 --> 00:29:45.460 line:0%
is likely Princess Ying herself.

00:29:46.640 --> 00:29:48.890 line:0%
Could they be using the banquets

00:29:48.960 --> 00:29:50.320 line:0%
to curry favor with the wives of

00:29:50.320 --> 00:29:51.780 line:0%
high-ranking officials?

00:29:51.920 --> 00:29:53.120 line:0%
Then through pillow talk,

00:29:53.120 --> 00:29:54.000 line:0%
they're able to gain insights into

00:29:54.000 --> 00:29:56.660 line:0%
the thoughts and movements of those officials.

00:30:03.800 --> 00:30:04.520 line:0%
No wonder Prime Minister Zhang

00:30:04.520 --> 00:30:05.880 line:0%
is so wary of her.

00:30:06.880 --> 00:30:08.940 line:0%
Do you know much about Princess Ying?

00:30:10.320 --> 00:30:11.360 line:0%
Princess Ying

00:30:12.440 --> 00:30:14.120 line:0%
is highly favored by the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:30:14.120 --> 00:30:16.260 line:0%
On the surface, she seems to indulge in pleasure all day,

00:30:16.260 --> 00:30:18.190 line:0%
but actually, she's quite shrewd.

00:30:19.120 --> 00:30:20.600 line:0%
But you don't need to worry.

00:30:20.600 --> 00:30:21.320 line:0%
I think she'll

00:30:21.320 --> 00:30:22.520 line:0%
come to find you soon.

00:30:22.680 --> 00:30:23.660 line:0%
What do you mean?

00:30:24.800 --> 00:30:25.680 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:30:25.680 --> 00:30:26.480 line:0%
Come in.

00:30:29.200 --> 00:30:31.060 line:0%
Princess Ying has sent an invi...

00:30:37.560 --> 00:30:39.160 line:0%
Princess Ying has sent an invitation

00:30:39.160 --> 00:30:41.560 line:0%
to invite Madam to attend a flower banquet.

00:30:45.950 --> 00:30:48.760 line:0%
[Princess Yong'an's Mansion]

00:30:46.150 --> 00:30:47.920 line:0%
Isn't that the Grand Commander's wife?

00:30:47.920 --> 00:30:49.280 line:0%
Is there no one to do her hair?

00:30:49.280 --> 00:30:50.200 line:0%
I just saw Madam Wu.

00:30:50.200 --> 00:30:51.680 line:0%
She didn't look well.

00:30:51.680 --> 00:30:52.360 line:0%
I heard that

00:30:52.360 --> 00:30:54.560 line:0%
her husband has a courtesan on the side.

00:30:54.790 --> 00:30:56.840 line:0%
It's her own fault for being so foolish back then,

00:30:56.840 --> 00:30:57.600 line:0%
insisting on marrying

00:30:57.600 --> 00:30:58.960 line:0%
that minor official from the Ministry of Justice.

00:30:58.960 --> 00:31:00.070 line:0%
Men,

00:31:00.090 --> 00:31:01.440 line:0%
with power or without,

00:31:01.520 --> 00:31:02.840 line:0%
rich or poor,

00:31:02.840 --> 00:31:04.410 line:0%
they're all the same.

00:31:04.640 --> 00:31:05.700 line:0%
Exactly.

00:31:05.760 --> 00:31:06.920 line:0%
I've also heard that

00:31:06.920 --> 00:31:08.120 line:0%
Madam Tang

00:31:08.240 --> 00:31:10.000 line:0%
once fancied a poor young man.

00:31:10.240 --> 00:31:11.800 line:0%
She was so fond of him.

00:31:11.800 --> 00:31:12.600 line:0%
But in the end,

00:31:12.600 --> 00:31:14.660 line:0%
that man eloped with a courtesan.

00:31:16.080 --> 00:31:17.200 line:0%
How come I haven't heard about this?

00:31:17.200 --> 00:31:18.640 line:0%
Do you know why Madam Tang

00:31:18.640 --> 00:31:19.640 line:0%
and Princess Ying

00:31:19.640 --> 00:31:20.680 line:0%
are on good terms?

00:31:20.760 --> 00:31:21.640 line:0%
Why?

00:31:22.480 --> 00:31:23.360 line:0%
Because

00:31:23.480 --> 00:31:25.280 line:0%
they both fancy poor young men.

00:31:26.840 --> 00:31:28.200 line:0%
That's right.

00:31:28.320 --> 00:31:29.320 line:0%
Indeed.

00:31:29.480 --> 00:31:30.400 line:0%
Here she comes.

00:31:34.840 --> 00:31:36.570 line:0%
Please have mercy on me, Madam.

00:31:40.800 --> 00:31:41.600 line:0%
It's alright.

00:31:41.620 --> 00:31:43.140 line:0%
I was careless.

00:31:43.320 --> 00:31:44.320 line:0%
Thank you, Madam.

00:31:44.360 --> 00:31:45.160 line:0%
Look.

00:31:45.280 --> 00:31:46.720 line:0%
How gracious

00:31:46.720 --> 00:31:48.040 line:0%
the wife of Grand Commander Shen is.

00:31:48.040 --> 00:31:50.440 line:0%
Isn't she the illegitimate daughter of the Yan family?

00:31:50.440 --> 00:31:51.800 line:0%
She's completely transformed

00:31:51.800 --> 00:31:54.600 line:0%
and now truly looks like a lady from a noble family.

00:31:55.480 --> 00:31:56.600 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, this is your first time

00:31:56.600 --> 00:31:57.720 line:0%
attending this kind of banquet.

00:31:57.720 --> 00:31:59.180 line:0%
You might not be used to it.

00:31:59.280 --> 00:32:01.410 line:0%
Actually, it's not usually like this.

00:32:01.760 --> 00:32:03.000 line:0%
[Madam Tang, Meng Ceran]

00:32:04.200 --> 00:32:05.960 line:0%
It's just that Madam Liu we met earlier,

00:32:05.960 --> 00:32:07.560 line:0%
her husband was

00:32:07.560 --> 00:32:11.690 line:0%
taken in for questioning by the Imperial Security Bureau a few months ago.

00:32:12.760 --> 00:32:13.560 line:0%
It's alright.

00:32:14.520 --> 00:32:16.040 line:0%
This is what happens

00:32:16.120 --> 00:32:18.080 line:0%
when the husband offends people outside.

00:32:18.080 --> 00:32:19.540 line:0%
The wife has to apologize.

00:32:20.840 --> 00:32:21.600 line:0%
So, Mrs. Shen,

00:32:21.600 --> 00:32:22.840 line:0%
don't take it to heart.

00:32:22.840 --> 00:32:23.400 line:0%
They're just

00:32:23.400 --> 00:32:25.530 line:0%
indulging in some gossip, that's all.

00:32:28.400 --> 00:32:29.520 line:0%
I see that your dress

00:32:29.520 --> 00:32:30.520 line:0%
is wet, Mrs. Shen.

00:32:30.680 --> 00:32:31.320 line:0%
Why don't you

00:32:31.320 --> 00:32:32.280 line:0%
come with me

00:32:32.280 --> 00:32:33.560 line:0%
and get changed?

00:32:37.200 --> 00:32:37.880 line:0%
Let's go.

00:32:47.880 --> 00:32:50.080 line:0%
This place is called the Medicinal Spring Bath.

00:32:50.080 --> 00:32:51.250 line:0%
Soaking in it

00:32:51.440 --> 00:32:53.040 line:0%
can nourish health and heal injuries.

00:32:53.040 --> 00:32:54.800 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, your clothes got wet, and you've been exposed to cold air.

00:32:54.800 --> 00:32:55.520 line:0%
Why don't you go up there

00:32:55.520 --> 00:32:56.800 line:0%
and enjoy it?

00:32:57.430 --> 00:32:59.050 line:0%
This is too precious.

00:32:59.160 --> 00:33:00.280 line:0%
I think I'd better...

00:33:00.280 --> 00:33:01.080 line:0%
I'm currently testing

00:33:01.080 --> 00:33:02.360 line:0%
a new formula for the medicinal spring.

00:33:02.360 --> 00:33:02.960 line:0%
Now that you're here,

00:33:02.960 --> 00:33:04.480 line:0%
you can help me test

00:33:04.680 --> 00:33:06.880 line:0%
the effectiveness of this new formula.

00:33:10.240 --> 00:33:13.240 line:0%
So you even know how to dispense medicine, Madam Tang?

00:33:16.200 --> 00:33:18.000 line:0%
I only know a little bit about it.

00:33:29.240 --> 00:33:30.040 line:0%
That's right.

00:33:30.320 --> 00:33:31.600 line:0%
The scent of camphor.

00:33:32.440 --> 00:33:33.680 line:0%
That day outside Ximing Temple,

00:33:33.680 --> 00:33:35.680 line:0%
she was the one who was spying there.

00:33:42.600 --> 00:33:43.740 line:0%
This is a fire moth.

00:33:43.800 --> 00:33:45.400 line:0%
I've heard a legend.

00:33:45.520 --> 00:33:47.070 line:0%
Someone saw a fire moth

00:33:47.400 --> 00:33:49.310 line:0%
and followed it up the mountain.

00:33:49.400 --> 00:33:50.310 line:0%
After that,

00:33:50.760 --> 00:33:53.400 line:0%
that person miraculously gained immortality.

00:33:53.400 --> 00:33:54.400 line:0%
Madam Tang.

00:33:54.400 --> 00:33:56.520 line:0%
Someone like you, with such a temperament,

00:33:56.520 --> 00:33:58.600 line:0%
also longs for eternal youth?

00:34:04.080 --> 00:34:06.020 line:0%
Life is just a few short decades.

00:34:06.240 --> 00:34:07.170 line:0%
If

00:34:07.520 --> 00:34:09.380 line:0%
there's something you want to do,

00:34:09.720 --> 00:34:11.680 line:0%
don't hesitate at all.

00:34:12.280 --> 00:34:14.120 line:0%
If you try to realize your dreams

00:34:14.120 --> 00:34:16.010 line:0%
after youth has passed,

00:34:16.160 --> 00:34:17.729 line:0%
I'm afraid by that time,

00:34:17.950 --> 00:34:20.280 line:0%
you'll have the will but not the strength.

00:34:21.320 --> 00:34:22.780 line:0%
You're absolutely right.

00:34:27.080 --> 00:34:27.720 line:0%
Here.

00:34:33.840 --> 00:34:35.360 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, you're exceptionally intelligent,

00:34:35.360 --> 00:34:37.600 line:0%
and you share a deep bond with the Grand Commander.

00:34:37.600 --> 00:34:38.600 line:0%
The serial murder case in the city

00:34:38.600 --> 00:34:40.060 line:0%
being entrusted to you two

00:34:40.320 --> 00:34:41.720 line:0%
is truly reassuring.

00:34:45.680 --> 00:34:46.740 line:0%
Speaking of which,

00:34:47.760 --> 00:34:50.430 line:0%
the Liang family has indeed faced many hardships.

00:34:50.430 --> 00:34:51.950 line:0%
I have regular interactions

00:34:51.950 --> 00:34:53.280 line:0%
with the first wife of the Liang family.

00:34:53.280 --> 00:34:55.080 line:0%
Poor thing. She's such a beauty,

00:34:55.080 --> 00:34:57.720 line:0%
yet her husband doesn't even look at her properly.

00:34:57.720 --> 00:34:58.520 line:0%
Now,

00:34:59.200 --> 00:35:00.640 line:0%
she has also lost her son.

00:35:01.450 --> 00:35:06.110 line:0%
So the marital relationship between Mr. Liang and his first wife is not harmonious?

00:35:06.200 --> 00:35:07.400 line:0%
Look at my loose tongue.

00:35:07.400 --> 00:35:08.120 line:0%
The officials' family matters

00:35:08.120 --> 00:35:09.600 line:0%
should not be disclosed.

00:35:10.880 --> 00:35:11.800 line:0%
Please, Mrs. Shen,

00:35:11.800 --> 00:35:13.200 line:0%
don't take it seriously.

00:35:15.440 --> 00:35:17.510 line:0%
Please let Madam Liang know

00:35:17.680 --> 00:35:19.810 line:0%
that the murderer will be caught soon.

00:35:21.600 --> 00:35:23.280 line:0%
No matter how deep they hide.

00:35:26.650 --> 00:35:27.600 line:0%
Mrs. Shen.

00:35:27.600 --> 00:35:28.280 line:0%
Her Highness, Princess Ying,

00:35:28.280 --> 00:35:30.940 line:0%
invites you to discuss matters after your bath.

00:35:31.360 --> 00:35:32.160 line:0%
Got it.

00:35:45.360 --> 00:35:48.010 line:0%
[Wind and Rhyme]

00:35:52.000 --> 00:35:53.480 line:0%
I've been waiting here for four hours.

00:35:53.480 --> 00:35:54.810 line:0%
Why hasn't she come yet?

00:35:58.390 --> 00:36:00.720 line:0%
[Wind and Rhyme]

00:36:10.270 --> 00:36:12.100 line:0%
[Wind and Rhyme]

00:36:17.730 --> 00:36:18.940 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:36:19.270 --> 00:36:22.100 line:0%
[Wind and Rhyme]

00:36:27.640 --> 00:36:29.770 line:0%
The flowers outside are in full bloom.

00:36:29.920 --> 00:36:32.180 line:0%
Sorry that I forgot about you, Mrs. Shen.

00:36:35.710 --> 00:36:37.800 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, there's no need to be nervous.

00:36:37.800 --> 00:36:39.360 line:0%
I called you here this time

00:36:39.960 --> 00:36:42.200 line:0%
just for a casual chat, nothing more.

00:36:48.800 --> 00:36:49.880 line:0%
However,

00:36:50.900 --> 00:36:52.760 line:0%
case investigation is one thing.

00:36:53.390 --> 00:36:54.950 line:0%
As for other matters,

00:37:00.030 --> 00:37:01.880 line:0%
it's best not to get involved.

00:37:38.460 --> 00:37:41.060 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, you're so clever and quick-witted.

00:37:42.120 --> 00:37:44.480 line:0%
You should understand what I mean, right?

00:38:13.480 --> 00:38:16.200 line:0%
Hasn't your husband taught you the principle that

00:38:16.200 --> 00:38:18.730 line:0%
a good bird chooses the right tree to perch on?

00:38:28.030 --> 00:38:28.830 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:38:28.570 --> 00:38:30.770 line:0%
[Wind and Rhyme]

00:38:28.970 --> 00:38:29.800 line:0%
The Grand Commander is here

00:38:29.800 --> 00:38:31.060 line:0%
to take Mrs. Shen home.

00:38:35.740 --> 00:38:37.390 line:0%
It's only been half a day,

00:38:37.480 --> 00:38:38.760 line:0%
yet the Grand Commander

00:38:38.760 --> 00:38:41.290 line:0%
is already so concerned about you, Mrs. Shen.

00:38:43.680 --> 00:38:45.160 line:0%
It seems the rumors in town

00:38:45.160 --> 00:38:46.760 line:0%
are not unfounded after all.

00:38:48.040 --> 00:38:49.730 line:0%
The bond between you two

00:38:50.100 --> 00:38:52.160 line:0%
is truly enviable to others.

00:38:55.680 --> 00:38:56.930 line:0%
Let him in.

00:38:56.650 --> 00:39:00.520 line:0%
[Wind and Rhyme]

00:38:57.120 --> 00:38:57.920 line:0%
Yes.

00:39:11.180 --> 00:39:13.300 line:0%
[Wind and Rhyme]

00:39:14.980 --> 00:39:17.760 line:0%
[Wind and Rhyme]

00:39:22.080 --> 00:39:23.400 line:0%
The flower banquet has ended for a while,

00:39:23.400 --> 00:39:25.000 line:0%
yet my wife hasn't returned.

00:39:25.280 --> 00:39:27.160 line:0%
I thought she might have lost her way in the vast palace.

00:39:27.160 --> 00:39:28.190 line:0%
I was worried,

00:39:28.280 --> 00:39:29.680 line:0%
so I came to take her home.

00:39:29.930 --> 00:39:30.990 line:0%
After all, at home,

00:39:31.400 --> 00:39:32.360 line:0%
there are still many trivial matters

00:39:32.360 --> 00:39:33.960 line:0%
that require her attention.

00:39:35.560 --> 00:39:38.240 line:0%
Grand Commander, you've even come in person to take her home.

00:39:38.240 --> 00:39:40.520 line:0%
If I were to keep Mrs. Shen any longer,

00:39:41.080 --> 00:39:43.410 line:0%
wouldn't that be too inconsiderate of me?

00:39:47.600 --> 00:39:49.130 line:0%
However, there's one thing

00:39:49.760 --> 00:39:52.220 line:0%
I still need to remind you, Grand Commander.

00:39:53.580 --> 00:39:56.710 line:0%
Investigating the murder case is of utmost importance.

00:39:58.240 --> 00:40:00.640 line:0%
Thank you for the reminder, Your Highness.

00:41:15.240 --> 00:41:16.120 line:0%
Are you hurt?

00:41:27.390 --> 00:41:28.960 line:0%
I'm actually bleeding.

00:41:41.120 --> 00:41:42.000 line:0%
Did Princess Ying force you

00:41:42.000 --> 00:41:42.930 line:0%
to eat anything?

00:41:44.760 --> 00:41:46.020 line:0%
Could you be poisoned?

00:41:49.680 --> 00:41:52.210 line:0%
You've traveled a long way, Grand Commander.

00:41:53.490 --> 00:41:54.880 line:0%
Since we're in the carriage now,

00:41:54.880 --> 00:41:56.410 line:0%
others can no longer see us.

00:42:03.000 --> 00:42:03.800 line:0%
Did you

00:42:04.630 --> 00:42:06.280 line:0%
already anticipate

00:42:06.440 --> 00:42:09.040 line:0%
that my visit to the palace would be dangerous?

00:42:11.480 --> 00:42:13.480 line:0%
A person who has just learned to walk

00:42:13.480 --> 00:42:14.840 line:0%
won't know how painful it is to fall

00:42:14.840 --> 00:42:17.040 line:0%
unless they experience it themselves.

00:42:18.480 --> 00:42:19.240 line:0%
Besides, you uncovered

00:42:19.240 --> 00:42:21.000 line:0%
one of Princess Ying's biggest secrets.

00:42:21.000 --> 00:42:23.680 line:0%
It's not unreasonable for her to give you a scolding.

00:42:23.680 --> 00:42:25.930 line:0%
We both uncovered her secret,

00:42:26.080 --> 00:42:28.080 line:0%
yet I was the only one being scolded.

00:42:31.480 --> 00:42:32.500 line:0%
However,

00:42:32.790 --> 00:42:34.440 line:0%
you coming here is somewhat...

00:42:34.440 --> 00:42:35.500 line:0%
No need to thank me.

00:42:36.240 --> 00:42:38.370 line:0%
You wrote a memorial to save me before.

00:42:38.520 --> 00:42:40.180 line:0%
I'm just returning the favor.

00:42:45.520 --> 00:42:47.560 line:0%
During the previous investigation by the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:42:47.560 --> 00:42:48.320 line:0%
did you find

00:42:48.320 --> 00:42:51.380 line:0%
that Mr. Liang and his first wife are not getting along?

00:42:51.520 --> 00:42:53.120 line:0%
It's just domestic affairs.

00:42:53.160 --> 00:42:54.960 line:0%
Why should we investigate them?

00:42:56.440 --> 00:42:57.560 line:0%
His first wife has indeed been harassing

00:42:57.560 --> 00:42:59.280 line:0%
the second wife's uncles constantly,

00:42:59.280 --> 00:43:00.840 line:0%
making a fuss every day.

00:43:01.320 --> 00:43:02.200 line:0%
Fortunately, that Liang Jiren

00:43:02.200 --> 00:43:03.760 line:0%
seems to understand the bigger picture.

00:43:03.760 --> 00:43:06.560 line:0%
He hasn't made things difficult for the second branch.

00:43:06.560 --> 00:43:08.420 line:0%
Liang Chenzhong was the only son.

00:43:08.960 --> 00:43:10.170 line:0%
So the first branch

00:43:10.240 --> 00:43:12.770 line:0%
has been left without an heir by the murderer.

00:43:13.240 --> 00:43:14.680 line:0%
There are many who hate him.

00:43:14.680 --> 00:43:16.280 line:0%
Even if his heart hadn't been carved out,

00:43:16.280 --> 00:43:17.880 line:0%
he wouldn't have lived much longer.

00:43:17.880 --> 00:43:19.840 line:0%
The person who poisoned him with the Water Dropwort

00:43:19.840 --> 00:43:21.370 line:0%
also had murderous intent.

00:43:21.720 --> 00:43:22.440 line:0%
It's just he or she wasn't

00:43:22.440 --> 00:43:24.320 line:0%
as quick as that serial killer.